### byteverifier JSON 服务请求样例
### 先启动:  python -m byteverifier serve --port 8080

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/health

### 编译一个合法程序，拿回 module_hex（供 verify/mutate 使用）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/compile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "int fact(int n) { if (n < 2) { return 1; } return n * fact(n-1); } void main() { print_int(fact(5)); }"
}

### 直接运行源码
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "void main() { int s=0; int i=1; while (i<=10) { s=s+i; i=i+1; } print_int(s); }",
  "fuel": 100000
}

### 验证一个未初始化局部量的模块（应 ok=false，local.uninit + shortest_path）
### module_hex 由 compile "void main() { int x; print_int(x); }" 得到
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "module_hex": "4256010001046d61696e0300010101070011000050f0ff520000"
}

### 单字节变异：把模块第 19 字节整字节替换为 0xFF
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/mutate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "module_hex": "4256010001046d61696e0300010101070011000050f0ff520000",
  "byte": 19,
  "value": 255
}

### 等价的 curl 命令：
###   curl -s -X POST localhost:8080/run -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
###        -d '{"source":"void main(){ print_int(6*7); }"}'
